# The configuration of the targets whose sources are all test code, over
# the configuration of each source's own directory in the checkout. The
# build composes them at configure (tidy_config.cmake) into a file of the
# build tree it names for those sources' steps: clang-tidy's dump, its
# CheckOptions block rebuilt from every entry of the chain of .clang-tidy
# and this file, as clang-tidy reads it; a file it cannot read stops the
# configure. A header takes the source it is compiled through. A check off
# here is an entry of analysis-exemptions.json with the scope "test code".
InheritParentConfig: true
